    {
      "id": "05-proteins",
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "proteins",
      "text": "13.3 grams of protein. That amount is useful enough to count. Essential amino acids score is 7 out of 9, making the protein useful for repair and maintenance, and it is still a strong secondary mark. For grains, protein helps, but the carb side still matters more.",
