    {
      "id": "06-vitamins",
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "vitamins",
      "text": "Vitamins are low all round. For grains, vitamins are more of a bonus after carb quality and minerals, so this section isn't doing much.",
