      },
      "productionAudioFile": "production/episodes/buckwheat/voice/voice-v1-blocks/09-cons.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "10-closing_summary",
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "closing_summary",
      "sectionKey": null,
      "text": "Big strengths are protein, fibre, and magnesium, but the biggest weaknesses are low vitamin E, low calcium, and low omega 3. It's good for heart health, digestion, and energy because fibre is useful for heart health, fibre helps digestion and keeps meals steadier, and the carb section gives it a clear fuel role.",
